        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Roles: Governor of Santiago del Estero\n- People: Claudia Ledesma Abdala\n- Places: Santiago del Estero Province, Argentina, Salta, Chaco, Santa Fe, Córdoba, Catamarca, Tucumán\n\nFacts:\n- Santiago del Estero is a province in northern Argentina.\n- The Governor of Santiago del Estero is a citizen of Santiago del Estero Province, Argentina, who holds the office of governor for the corresponding term.\n- Claudia Ledesma Abdala is currently identified in the chunk as the governor of Salta.\n- Santiago del Estero Province borders Salta, Chaco, Santa Fe, Córdoba, Catamarca, and Tucumán in clockwise order from the north.",
